{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_st02","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-ST-2","storyName":"罗曼史已死","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"高尚的红龙回到城中。为赢得更多人的未来，她直面贪婪的红龙，杀死她，却也哀悼她。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_st02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_st02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["冰冷的幼龙","温热的幼龙","高尚的红龙","贪婪的红龙"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你刚刚讲到......是了，夏末节前夜，太阳还挂在天上的时候。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":8},{"type":"subtitle","text":"夏末节的夜晚将连通生命与死亡，这并不是迷信，或者，它早就超出了迷信的范畴。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"塔拉的传说中，无数伟业与惨剧都在这一夜发生，而这些传说往往不会费心在日期上故弄玄虚。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"只要无数传说都重合在这一天，只要塔拉人还隐约记得要在这一天庆祝丰收，点起火焰，它就不只是一个无聊的时节。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"它自身就是神话最好的注脚。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......哦，还有，我替你故事里的角色取些更贴切的名字，想必你也不会在意的，对吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","id":14},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":15},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":16},{"type":"charslot","id":17},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":18},{"type":"subtitle","text":"太阳已经西斜。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":19},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我们是还没想好该如何见这最后一次面吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":20},{"type":"subtitle","id":21},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":23},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":24,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"拉芙希妮，你怎么又在吃饭时躲进自己房间里了？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"爸爸生气了吗？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8D/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"没有，不过快了。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#14$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"我这就去——","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#22$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"你桌上是什么？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"没什么！","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FD/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":42},{"type":"charslot","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"年幼的红龙试图用身体挡住姐姐的视线，但这完全是徒劳。","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"她桌上放着一个小小的纸盒，里面仔细地用棉花铺好，上面躺着一只已经死去，但尚有余温的小小羽兽。","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"羽兽的腿似乎在活着的时候断掉了，旁边散落着硬纸做的不成功的夹板，还有几颗麦粒。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#22$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"这是每天早上都来我窗前唱歌的羽兽，不知为什么变成了这个样子......我想救它，可是......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#14$1","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"......","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1C/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"求你了，姐姐，求你去告诉爸爸，我只是不舒服，我明天会按时出现在餐桌前......我今晚就去把它埋到院子里。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#22$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"你要放弃了吗？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"它已经死了呀，姐姐。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"是吗？","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_magic_n","volume":"0.5","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"紫色的火焰从羽毛间渗入羽兽已然冰冷的尸体。","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"在两人的注视之下，羽兽缓缓站了起来，断掉的腿硬邦邦地直抵在棉花上，支撑着僵硬的躯壳。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"好了，你想让它飞起来吗，还是唱首歌给你听？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"不，不——不该是这样的，不是的！","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FD/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"......","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"如果你不想这样，为什么不在它还活着的时候用你的火呢？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#17$1","focus":"r","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"你的羽兽原本还可以活上很久。你知道自己本不必拘泥于那些庸人的做法。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温热的幼龙","text":"不，妈妈告诉过我，把火焰吞下去，藏起来，不要被人看到......","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冰冷的幼龙","text":"有谁会看到呢？","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"幼龙移开视线，不去看姐姐的眼睛，却正好看到了僵硬地站在棉花小床上的羽兽。","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"那羽兽眼中燃烧着紫火，就连略略歪着脑袋的样子，都和姐姐一模一样。","id":90},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"subtitle","text":"或者，我们心中都还抱着不切实际的奢望？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":95},{"type":"subtitle","id":96},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":97},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_34_g6_noblelivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","duration":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"姐姐，你身上有血......你受伤了？！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"我的血不多，那个大公爵派来的探子的血不少。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我来替你包扎......","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"沃里克伯爵呢？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#6","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"他去......办事。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"是的，他一向告诉我们自己是去办事，而你则满足于这个字眼。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"他甚至放任那位探子，在自己去“办事”的时候和你探讨诗歌。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#2","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我以为我没有泄漏任何跟我们的身世、跟伯爵的理想相关的消息......","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"伯爵府上的每个人都知道你从不说多余的话，沃里克伯爵想确定的从来都不是这个。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#2","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"......","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"没错，就算你放跑了探子，沃里克伯爵也总有方法将他掐灭在黑暗中，而我们身上又会再多一条细细的枷锁。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#2","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"对不起，我......","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"不必道歉，道歉也是徒劳。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"往日宾朋满座的会客厅里空空荡荡，撕开绷带的哧哧声反倒让空气更显得滞重。","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"你最近很喜欢的那位西莫·威廉姆斯的诗，如果能想得起来，就帮我念两句吧。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"text","text":"高尚的红龙在腹中搜刮能不触怒姐姐的诗句，也许是关于塔拉的，关于战士的，哪怕关于那些古老的传说——","id":136},{"type":"text","text":"但她只想起一些与世无争的句子。","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"“大地不过是一段陌生的传奇，结尾因不幸的偶然丢失。”","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"“我不过是一个吟游诗人，只熟习森林中传唱的知识......”","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"charslot","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"她偷眼看向姐姐的面庞，没看到什么变化，于是她大着胆子，继续念诵下去。","id":143},{"type":"text","text":"直到整首诗都被她念完，绷带也打上了精致的结，她才发现，姐姐已经在诗句的环绕下沉沉睡去。","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"charslot","id":149},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":150},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_bg_59_g13_castlebalcony.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":152},{"type":"subtitle","text":"或者......？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":153},{"type":"subtitle","id":154},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":156},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":157,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"姐姐。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"啊，拉芙希妮，我等你很久了。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"你新交的朋友们呢？那位离群的守灵人，还有活泼的游牧民姑娘？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"只要有你在，阻止你们来到这里的一切障碍应该都已经荡然无存了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"她们已经在城里了，但此时此刻，这是我们两个人之间的事。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"是啊。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1C/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"阳台上风冷，我们进到走廊里说吧。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"拉布雷德的葬身之处在纳斯尔纱的复制品......你就真的这么拘泥于重复一段并不光彩的历史吗，姐姐？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"看来你对塔拉这个名词的理解又深了一些。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"可历史若是不重复，我们又谈何将其打破呢？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"subtitle","text":"要从外表区分我们，很难。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":183},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可一旦我们中的哪一个先开了口，辨别我们姐妹就再简单不过。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":184},{"type":"subtitle","text":"爱布拉娜只随着自己的兴趣转变话题，而拉芙希妮从来都是更有礼貌的那个。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":185},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她会为了一个故事的结局刨根问底——","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":186},{"type":"subtitle","text":"别打岔，先生。我在说故事里的人物。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":187},{"type":"subtitle","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_59_g11_castlecorridor_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"爱布拉娜，我很抱歉。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"不，我很高兴，你终于来赴我的约了。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"跳舞？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"是的，跳舞。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我会陪着你把那支舞跳完的。但......","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"先告诉我，姐姐，上次我们见面时，你说你等不起了......究竟是怎么回事？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"charslot","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"姐姐就那样微笑着立在长廊的尽头，妹妹则在壁灯的阴影中握紧双手，以为这样就不会被对方发觉自己内心的动摇......","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"可怜的孩子，她本来可以让这场道别快些结束的。","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"你变得......虚弱了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"死火有其定数，将其散布出去，的确在一步步将你拖垮，就像当年的拉布雷德......是这样吗？","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"看来那鬼魂的火焰与我相似，性情却让他和你走得更近。他真是帮了你不少的忙。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"他原本只想看整个塔拉被火焰焚尽呢。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"他只是在强撑罢了......","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"像你一样。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"高尚的红龙终于走出阴影，走上前去，搀扶住看起来几乎要站不住了的姐姐......就像从前那样。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"是吗？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"你终于又像很小很小的时候那样，像你还对自己的火焰和命运一无所知时那样，想站到我身前保护我了。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"真是过了很长时间了啊，拉芙希妮。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我记得那件事。隔壁的莫菲太太去世了，你不喜欢她，却喜欢她灵柩中那束美丽的花......","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"于是你用了你的火，让她换了个姿势躺在棺中。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我看见了花上的焦痕，觉得你会挨骂，就去跟父母说是自己干的，还花了心思，编造了把灵柩打开又关上的过程......","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"结果领受了父母的一顿责骂。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"可怜的爸爸妈妈连隐藏这家人的火都来不及，又怎么会去一束花边细细察看什么焦痕呢？","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"......是啊。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"这就是你一直退缩不前的原因吗？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"你会将漫长生活中所有的决定都归咎于童年的某次不幸的经历吗？","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"......哈哈。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"告诉我，姐姐，告诉我一切都还来得及。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我会陪你走上堡垒下的广场，让人们把火焰归还给你。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我会陪你走过塔拉的原野，让那些你有意或无意间用法术惊醒的死者安眠。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我会在你仍然虚弱的时分为你念诗，直到你睡去又醒来。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"一切都还来得及，对吗？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"我相信你言出必践，你的高尚让你无论如何都会信守承诺，拉芙希妮。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"但你刚刚描绘出的场景，真的会让你自己快乐吗？","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"还是说，这是只足以取悦那个连父母亡故的雪夜都还未曾经历的拉芙希妮·都柏林的......美好的幻象？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"......","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"拉芙希妮，诗是好的，爱是好的，梦是好的，但你的梦该醒了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"杀死我，这就是眼前的乱局唯一的解法，如果你真的想将其解决的话。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"然后，戴上那顶冠冕，你将成为我，我也将成为你。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"唯独这件事，我做不到。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"那你也可以在我死之后慢慢想。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"别再犹豫了，拉芙希妮。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"既然你选择回来见我，我们之间的选择就只剩下一个。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"姐姐的嘴角勾起一个耐人寻味的弧度。","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"来跳舞吧，拉芙希妮。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"这就是你......一直期盼至今的舞？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"它为什么不可以是呢？","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"妹妹闭上双眼，对准姐姐随时都要倒下的身躯，用双手端起枪。","id":281},{"type":"dialog","id":282},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cnstrctnck","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_daggerslow","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"锋芒贯穿红龙的身躯，但她仍然还在那里站着，仿佛什么都没发生，直到妹妹的手环上她的腰间，那身躯才缓缓倒下......","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"......正如一支跳到终局的舞。","id":288},{"type":"dialog","id":289},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_59_i08.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"是，我知道。","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我早就应该知道的，姐姐。","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"可是为什么，为什么偏偏要是现在？","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"......不然呢？","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"难道你想在某个日光正好的午后，在和我细细争论过孰是孰非之后，再把你的枪刺入我的心脏？","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"你回来了，我们共同跳了这支舞，这就够了。","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我只是以为，只要投入合适的火中，悲伤和仇恨也终将成为让生活继续的燃料。","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"悲伤、仇恨......你还是承认了，拉芙希妮。","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"......","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"但你的高尚终于还是害了你。你的火呢，拉芙希妮？","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我不能就这样将你的火毁去。","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"哈，你是说......城里人？","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"你会死，但你的火焰应当在你的葬礼，你的还火仪式上熄灭，而不是现在。","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"可是，拉芙希妮，你早该让滚烫的烈火驱散死亡，而不是费心挽着死者的手，诉说自己内心的纠结与悔恨，不然......","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贪婪的红龙","text":"你只会像现在这样，放跑挽救一切的......最后的机会。","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":309},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":313},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":314,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","id":315},{"type":"image","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","id":317},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_59_g11_castlecorridor_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_deathburning","layer":"3","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"高尚的红龙惊愕地松开手，姐姐那并不比心脏被刺穿前更冰冷的身体落在地上。","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"并非鲜血，而是紫火，从那贯穿身体的伤口咆哮着涌出，顷刻间充满了整个长廊，流向整个堡垒......","id":325},{"type":"dialog","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":327},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"bgeffect","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"高尚的红龙飞奔向阳台，而紫色的死火比她更快。","id":333},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_bg_59_g13_castlebalcony.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":336},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_deathburning","layer":"3","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"她的火焰还来不及发出一点光芒，紫火就已经扩散开去，延烧到整座纳斯尔纱。","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"上次高尚的红龙在这里远眺时，城里的火焰还是星星点点。她再次进城时，紫火给城市铺上了一层阴冷的底色。","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"而现在......","id":342},{"type":"text","text":"纳斯尔纱正熊熊燃烧，正如她见过的每一位不得安宁的死者。","id":343},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"bgeffect","id":349},{"type":"background","id":350},{"type":"image","id":351}],"characters":["冰冷的幼龙","温热的幼龙","高尚的红龙","贪婪的红龙"]}